    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="| 相关文件 | (无) |">| Related Files | (none) |</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="| 相关文件 | {0} |">| Related Files | {0} |</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="| 详细信息 | {0} |">| Details | {0} |</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• data.json —— 存储所有条目数据（未完成 + 已完成），JSON 数组格式">• data.json — stores all entry data (unfinished + finished) as a JSON array</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• Date: / 日期: —— 日期（yyyy-MM-dd）">• Date: — date (yyyy-MM-dd)</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• Expand: / 扩展: / 已安装: —— 已安装的插件（全局搜索）">• Expand: — installed plugins (global search)</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• File: / 文件: —— 关联文件路径与函数名">• File: — related-file path and function name</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• Plugins: / 插件: —— 扩展中心插件（全局搜索）">• Plugins: — Extension Center plugins (global search)</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• project.json —— 存储项目元数据：项目名称、类型标签定义、版本号等">• project.json — stores project metadata: project name, type tag definitions, version number, etc.</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• Setting: / 设置: / 配置: —— 设置（全局搜索）">• Setting: / settings: — settings (global search)</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• Tag: / 标签: —— 类型标签">• Tag: — type tags</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• Text: / 文字: —— 标题、简要、详情">• Text: — title, brief, details</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 典型用法：0 = 无变更 / 1-3 = 小范围调整 / 4-6 = 中等重构 / 7+ = 大规模变更">• Typical usage: 0 = no change / 1-3 = small adjustments / 4-6 = medium refactor / 7+ = large-scale change</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 分类浏览 —— 按插件类别分组展示可用扩展">• Browse by category — available extensions are grouped and shown by category</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 删除 —— 移除已完成条目">• Delete — remove a finished entry</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 删除条目 —— 移除不需要的条目（不可恢复）">• Delete entry — remove an unwanted entry (irreversible)</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 通过「版本管理」弹窗新建、打开或删除版本，新条目将归属当前版本">• Create, open, or delete versions via the "Version Management" dialog; new entries belong to the current version</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 安装 / 卸载 —— 一键安装或卸载扩展插件">• Install / uninstall — install or remove an extension with one click</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 完成日期 —— 每条目卡片额外显示「完成于」日期信息">• Completion date — each entry card also shows a Completed-on date</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 完成条目 —— 将条目标记为已完成，自动记录完成时间，条目从本页移至已完成页面">• Complete entry — mark an entry as finished, record the completion time automatically, and move it from this page to the Finished page</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 导航栏      仪表盘 / 未完成条目 / 已完成条目 / 扩展中心 / 帮助">• Navigation      Dashboard / Unfinished / Finished / Extensions / Help</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 展开详情 —— 点击「详情」按钮展开条目完整信息面板，包括详细描述和关联文件表格">• Expand details — click the Details button to expand the full info panel, including the description and related-file table</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 工具栏      按住 Ctrl 显示：新建条目 / 搜索 / 排序 / 数据统计 / CLI 等快捷操作">• Toolbar      Hold Ctrl to show: New Entry / Search / Sort / Data Statistics / CLI shortcuts</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 已完成条目在版本内全部完成后才可归档，保持视图整洁">• Finished entries can only be archived after the whole version is finished, keeping the view tidy</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 常见标签：bug（缺陷）、feature（新功能）、refactor（重构）、docs（文档）、test（测试）、chore（杂项）">• Common tags: bug, feature, refactor, docs, test, chore</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 按版本归档 —— 仅当版本内所有条目均已完成时，才显示归档按钮。归档将导出 Markdown 并删除版本数据文件">• Archive by version — the archive button only appears when all entries in a version are finished. Archiving exports Markdown and deletes the version data file</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 排序 —— 按严重程度（高→低）、截止日期（近→远）、版本号（升/降）以及仅收藏排序">• Sorting — by severity (high→low), deadline (soonest→latest), version (asc/desc), or favorites only</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 搜索过滤 —— 顶部搜索框实时过滤插件列表">• Search filter — the top search box filters the plugin list in real time</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 搜索过滤 —— 顶部搜索框输入关键词实时过滤，支持前缀切换匹配范围：Text:内容、Tag:标签、Setting:设置（项目设置/主题/数据统计）、File:文件路径、Date:日期；不带前缀时按文字匹配，Setting: 下按回车执行设置项">• Search filter — type keywords in the top search box for real-time filtering, with prefix switches for match scope: Text: content, Tag: tags, Setting: settings (project/theme/data statistics), File: file path, Date: date; without a prefix it matches text, and under Setting: press Enter to run a setting</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 撤销完成 —— 将已完成条目恢复为未完成状态，条目移回 UnDonePage">• Undo completion — restore a finished entry to unfinished status, moving it back to UnDonePage</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 支持按变更需求升序或降序排列条目列表">• Entries can be sorted by change demand ascending or descending</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 收藏加星 —— 点击星标按钮收藏条目，收藏的条目在列表中高亮显示">• Favoriting — click the star button to favorite an entry; favorited entries are highlighted in the list</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 数值越大表示变更越复杂、影响范围越广">• The larger the value, the more complex and wide-ranging the change</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 数据存储    所有条目以 JSON 格式保存在各项目目录下">• Storage      All entries are saved as JSON in each project directory</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 整体结构与未完成页面一致 —— 版本分组、搜索过滤、详情展开等">• Same overall structure as the Unfinished page — version grouping, search filter, detail expansion, etc.</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 文件均为纯文本 JSON，可直接用 Git 进行版本追踪和团队协作">• All files are plain-text JSON, so they can be tracked with Git and used for team collaboration</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 条目列表按版本号分组展示，支持折叠和展开各版本">• The entry list is grouped by version, and each version can collapse/expand</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 条目字段：index, id, title, severity, severityLabel, brief, detail, deadline, completedAt, changeDemand, isFavorited, version, relatedFiles">• Entry fields: index, id, title, severity, severityLabel, brief, detail, deadline, completedAt, changeDemand, isFavorited, version, relatedFiles</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 条目结果带类型标签（未完成 / 已完成），点击「跳转」定位到对应条目。">• Entry results show a type label (Unfinished / Finished); click Go to locate the entry.</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 正常输出 JSON（stdout），带缩进便于阅读">• Normal output is JSON (stdout), indented for readability</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 每个条目可附带一个或多个类型标签（多选）">• Each entry can have one or more type tags (multi-select)</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 每个条目归属于一个版本，创建时自动设为当前版本">• Each entry belongs to a version and is set to the current version when created</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 使用命令 -v Iterate 将迭代编号 +1（如 alpha.0 → alpha.1）">• Use the command -v Iterate to increment the iteration number by 1 (e.g. alpha.0 → alpha.1)</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 点击搜索框外部关闭结果板。">• Click outside the search box to close the results board.</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 版本分组折叠 —— 条目按版本号分组，每组可折叠 / 展开，标题显示版本名和条目数">• Version grouping — entries are grouped by version; each group can collapse/expand, and its header shows the version name and entry count</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 状态栏      项目切换下拉框">• Status bar      Project switcher dropdown</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 空输入时显示「按模式搜索」引导，点击前缀按钮可快速填入前缀。">• With empty input, a search-by-mode guide appears; click a prefix chip to fill it in.</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 类型标签在条目卡片上以标签形式展示，便于快速识别">• Type tags appear as labels on entry cards for quick identification</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 类型标签在项目配置（project.json）中统一定义和管理">• Type tags are defined and managed centrally in the project config (project.json)</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 编辑 —— 与未完成页面相同的编辑功能">• Edit — the same editing as on the Unfinished page</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 编辑条目 —— 点击编辑按钮打开编辑窗口，可修改所有字段：标题、简要、详情、严重程度、截止日期、变更需求、类型标签、关联文件">• Edit entry — click the edit button to open the editor and modify all fields: title, brief, details, severity, deadline, change demand, type tags, related files</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 编辑条目时在编辑窗口勾选或取消类型标签">• Check or uncheck type tags in the editor when editing an entry</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 编辑条目时在编辑窗口设置">• Set it in the editor when editing an entry</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 详情查看 —— 点击插件卡片查看功能说明和使用方式">• View details — click a plugin card to see its description and usage</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 返回码：0 = 成功，非 0 = 失败">• Exit code: 0 = success, non-zero = failure</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="• 错误信息输出至 stderr">• Errors are written to stderr</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="、">, </s:String>
