    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="严重程度 —— 致命 / 严重 / 一般 / 补丁 / 更新">Severity — Fatal / Severe / General / Patch / Update</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="严重程度从高到低共分五级，每级以对应颜色标识：">There are five severity levels from high to low, each marked by its own color:</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="严重程度分布">Severity distribution</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="严重程度直接影响列表默认排序（高→低），同时在仪表盘分布图表中可视化。编辑条目时可随时调整。">Severity directly affects the default list sorting (high→low) and is visualized in the dashboard distribution chart. It can be adjusted at any time when editing an entry.</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="严重程度（Severity）">Severity</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="主版本.次版本.补丁版本-标签.迭代编号">major.minor.patch-tag.iteration</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="主题样式">Theme</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="默认主题">Default</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="主题色">Accent Color</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="从 GitHub Releases 检查新版本，确认后自动下载并运行安装程序。">Check GitHub Releases for new versions then download and run the installer after confirmation.</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="代码文件引用追踪">Code file reference tracking</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="以可视化图表展示五个严重等级（致命/严重/一般/补丁/更新）各自的条目数量，帮助快速识别项目风险分布。">Visualizes the entry count for each of the five severity levels (Fatal/Severe/General/Patch/Update), helping you quickly identify risk distribution.</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="仪表盘">Dashboard</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="仪表盘（LogPage）">Dashboard (LogPage)</s:String>
    <s:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="任务变更影响度量">Measuring task change impact</s:String>
